<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Services — Chief Cornerstone Landscaping</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/public.css">
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Our Services</h1>
    <p>Professional landscaping for residential and commercial properties across Texas.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/service-lawn.jpg" alt="Lawn Maintenance" class="service-card-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
        <div class="service-card-img-placeholder" style="display:none">🌿</div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <h3>Lawn Maintenance</h3>
          <p>Regular mowing, edging, blowing, and cleanup on a schedule that works for you. We show up on time, every time.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Weekly & bi-weekly plans</li>
            <li>Mowing, edging & trimming</li>
            <li>Debris cleanup & blowing</li>
            <li>Fertilization programs</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green">Get a Quote →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/service-design.jpg" alt="Landscape Design" class="service-card-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
        <div class="service-card-img-placeholder" style="display:none">🌳</div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <h3>Landscape Design</h3>
          <p>From concept to completion, we design outdoor spaces that are beautiful, functional, and built for your Texas climate.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Custom design plans</li>
            <li>Plant selection for Texas soil</li>
            <li>Full installation</li>
            <li>Before & after documentation</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green">Get a Quote →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/service-trimming.jpg" alt="Tree & Shrub Trimming" class="service-card-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
        <div class="service-card-img-placeholder" style="display:none">✂️</div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <h3>Tree & Shrub Trimming</h3>
          <p>Proper pruning keeps your trees and shrubs healthy, safe, and looking their best. We understand Texas species and seasonal timing.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Seasonal pruning</li>
            <li>Crown thinning & shaping</li>
            <li>Deadwood removal</li>
            <li>Stump grinding</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green">Get a Quote →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/service-irrigation.jpg" alt="Irrigation Systems" class="service-card-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
        <div class="service-card-img-placeholder" style="display:none">💧</div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <h3>Irrigation Systems</h3>
          <p>Smart irrigation that keeps your lawn green and your water bill manageable. Installation, repair, and seasonal adjustments.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>New system installation</li>
            <li>Repair & maintenance</li>
            <li>Smart controller upgrades</li>
            <li>Winterization</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green">Get a Quote →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/service-hardscape.jpg" alt="Hardscaping" class="service-card-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
        <div class="service-card-img-placeholder" style="display:none">🪨</div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <h3>Hardscaping</h3>
          <p>Patios, walkways, retaining walls, and outdoor living spaces that add value and beauty to your property for decades.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Patio & walkway installation</li>
            <li>Retaining walls</li>
            <li>Outdoor kitchens & fire pits</li>
            <li>Decorative stone & gravel</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green">Get a Quote →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/service-cleanup.jpg" alt="Seasonal Cleanup" class="service-card-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
        <div class="service-card-img-placeholder" style="display:none">🍂</div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <h3>Seasonal Cleanup</h3>
          <p>Get your property ready for every season. Spring and fall cleanup to remove debris, prepare beds, and set your lawn up for success.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Spring bed preparation</li>
            <li>Fall leaf removal</li>
            <li>Mulch installation</li>
            <li>Pre-winter prep</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green">Get a Quote →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cta">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center">
    <h2>Not Sure What You Need?</h2>
    <p>We'll come out, assess your property, and give you an honest recommendation — no pressure, no obligation.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold" style="margin-top:28px">Request a Free Estimate</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
